  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> </span><a href=\"https://www.kgmu.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">King George’s Medical University Uttar Pradesh KGMU</span></a> Lucknow has released the notification for the post of Various Non Teaching Group B and Group C. This recruitment has been issued for 332 posts. Candidates Can Also Check All Details on Official<a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">&nbsp;Sarkari Result 2025</a> website which is SarkariExam.com. Those Candidates Are Interested in the following recruitment can apply online from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">King George’s Medical University Uttar Pradesh KGMU</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">KGMU Non Teaching Recruitment 2025</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">KGMU Group B &amp; C Post Exam 2025 : Short Details of Notification</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>17 November 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong><b>11 December 2024</b></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>03 March 2025</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>03 March 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>Notify Soon</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General, EWS, OBC&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>: Rs. 2360/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST <strong>: Rs. 1416/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>KGMU Lucknow Non Teaching Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">As on 01 July 2024</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>40 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per KGMU Non Teaching Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>KGMU Non Teaching 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 332 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><b>Post Name</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><b>No. of Post</b></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Technical Officer (Medical Perfusion)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">04</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Technician (Radiology)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">49</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Technician (Radiotherapy)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">20</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Technical Officer (Ophthalmology)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">04</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Technical Officer (ENT)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">04</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Lab Technologist (Lab)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">29</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Jr. Medical Lab Technologist (Lab)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">07</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">OT Assistant (OT)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">65</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Technician (Nuclear Medicine)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">04</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Technician Gr 2 (Dental)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">04</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Technician (Dialysis)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">36</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Social Service Officer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">23</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Receptionist</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">23</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Pharmacist Gr-2</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">38</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Librarian Grade 2</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">04</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Security Officer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">11</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Computer Programmer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">07</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>KGMU Non Teaching Recruitment 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9199%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><b>Post Name</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.0801%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><b>Eligibility</b></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9199%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Technical Officer (Medical Perfusion</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.0801%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Bachelor Degree in Science B.Sc. with Perfusion Technology certificate from any recognized university&nbsp; &amp; college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">5 years Experience</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9199%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Technician (Radiology)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.0801%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates Must Have Passed 10+2 Intermediate Exam with Science OR</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;B.Sc. (Hons.) in Radiography Relevant experience.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9199%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Technician (Radiotherapy)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.0801%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates Must Have Passed 10+2 Intermediate Exam with Science OR</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;B.Sc. (Hons.) in Radiotherapy Relevant experience.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9199%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Technical Officer (Ophthalmology)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.0801%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Bachelor Degree in Science B.Sc. in Ophthalmic Techniques or equivalent, from any recognized university &amp; college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9199%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Technical Officer (ENT)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.0801%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Bachelor Degree in Science B.Sc. Degree in Speech and Hearing from any recognized university &amp; college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9199%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Lab Technologist (Lab)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.0801%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Bachelor’s Degree in Medical Laboratory Technology / Medical Laboratory Science from any recognized university &amp; college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">2 years Relevant Experience.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9199%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Jr. Medical Lab Technologist (Lab)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.0801%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates Must Have Passed 10+2 Intermediate Exam with Science and 2 years Diploma in Medical Laboratory Technology</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1 Year Experience.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9199%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">OT Assistant (OT)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.0801%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Bachelor Degree in Science B.Sc. from any recognized university &amp; college will be considered for this post. OR</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">10+2 with Science and 5 years experience in relevant area.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9199%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Technician (Nuclear Medicine)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.0801%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Bachelor Degree in Science B.Sc. in Life science plus one year diploma in Medical Radiation and Isotope Techniques from any recognized university &amp; college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9199%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Technician Gr 2 (Dental)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.0801%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates Must Have Passed Class 10th Matriculation or equivalent, Diploma in Dental Hygiene / Dental Mechanic / Maxillofacial prosthesis, registered.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9199%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Technician (Dialysis)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.0801%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Bachelor Degree in Science B.Sc. OR B.Sc. with Diploma in Dialysis Technology from any recognized university &amp; college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1 Year Experience.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9199%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Social Service Officer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.0801%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Master’s Degree in Social Work from any recognized university &amp; college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Experience in Welfare or Health Agency.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9199%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Receptionist</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.0801%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Degree from any recognized university &amp; college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">PG Diploma in Journalism / Public Relations preferred.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9199%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Pharmacist Gr-2</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.0801%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Diploma in Pharmacy from any recognized university &amp; college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Registered Pharmacist.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9199%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Librarian Grade 2</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.0801%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Bachelor Degree in Science B.Sc Degree OR Equivalent Degree with Diploma in Library Science from any recognized university &amp; college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9199%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Security Officer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.0801%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having&nbsp; Degree, height and chest measurements from any recognized university &amp; college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">5 years experience in security.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9199%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Computer Programmer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.0801%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having&nbsp; BE/B.Tech (Comp. Sc. / Comp. Engg.) OR Master in Computer Application from any recognized university &amp; college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>KGMU Non Teaching Online Form 2025 : How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://www.kgmu.org/ or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the KGMU Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sarkari Result 2025</a> Notification Here – <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Check Now.</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for KGMU Non Teaching recruitment can read all the information related to the recruitment is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>KG